# The document's unit (an extension): in an inch document a typed 1/4
# is kept as typed and saved in inches; a change to mm keeps every size
# and is one undo step. (TestDocumentUnitsInterface checks the message
# about parameters.)
menu View|Dimension Units|Dimensions in Inches
key s
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 400 250
down L 400 250
up L 400 250
key esc
key esc
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 400 250
down L 400 250
up L 400 250
key d
key esc
move 195 225
down L 195 225
up L 195 225
down L 195 225
dbl L 195 225
up L 195 225
dump
edit 1/4
dump
save
menu View|Dimension Units|Dimensions in Millimeters
dump
save
key z ctrl
dump
save
